  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Economic Stability and Transformation (ZEST) programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will support reforms to improve the economic and business environment in Zimbabwe, in order to unlock Zimbabwe&#x2019;s prosperity potential.  This will help reduce poverty in Zimbabwe through putting the country on a pathway to economic development and job creation. It will also benefit the UK through fostering trade and investment links</narrative>
  </description>
